        "TileImage": "$($repository f7788342-8af3-48a0-8136-fd81aa5bcdf5).Image",
        "Description": "Its seems that killing Jason Portman wasnt enough as he had just sold quantum to a friend. A high ranking couple within Quantum  are puplicly the owners but are in reality just cover for the real owner. Killing them and watching closely on Quantum data for new developments may lead us to the new owner who is just as relentless as Jason was at taking over for Kronstadt. The targets are a couple who have a past with the mafia. Kronstadt would prefer you make it look like a mob killing.",
